  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉狂热问答王！\n什么风把你吹到这里来了？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C838972C270ED95EE7B54738BFF01000A4EC04E4898CE628A4F60543952308FD991CC67654E86FF1F00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身为问答王你肯定知道，\n说起卡娜莉小姐的搭档，就是麻麻鳗鱼王。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB4E3A95EE7B54738B4F6080AF5B9A77E59053FF0C000A8BF48D7753615A1C83895C0F59D07684642D6863FF0C5C31662F9EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738B300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了和卡娜莉小姐用相同的宝可梦做搭档，\n我正在培育麻麻鳗。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86548C53615A1C83895C0F59D0752876F8540C76845B9D53EF68A6505A642D6863FF0C000A62116B63572857F980B29EBB9EBB9CD7300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "现在就差用雷之石把最强的麻麻鳗\n进化成麻麻鳗鱼王了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B057285C315DEE752896F74E4B77F3628A67005F3A76849EBB9EBB9CD7000A8FDB531662109EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738B4E86300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而在这个关键时刻，\n我竟然奇迹般地遇到了问答王！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C57288FD94E2A5173952E65F6523BFF0C000A62117ADF713659478FF9822C5730904752304E8695EE7B54738BFF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请和我对战吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n好让我选出\n最强、最麻的麻麻鳗！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7548C62115BF962185427FF0100100001BE01000A597D8BA96211900951FA000A67005F3A300167009EBB76849EBB9EBB9CD7FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好对战了，\n就来跟我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D5BF962184E86FF0C000A5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请和我对战吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n好让我选出\n最强、最麻的麻麻鳗！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7548C62115BF962185427FF0100100001BE01000A597D8BA96211900951FA000A67005F3A300167009EBB76849EBB9EBB9CD7FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "乐意奉陪！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E50610F5949966AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没问题！没问题！\n我当然会等你啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA195EE9898FF016CA195EE9898FF01000A62115F5371364F1A7B494F605566FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要请卡娜莉狂热问答王多指教，\n好让我分辨出最强的麻麻鳗是哪只！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818BF753615A1C838972C270ED95EE7B54738B591A63076559FF0C000A597D8BA9621152068FA851FA67005F3A76849EBB9EBB9CD7662F54EA53EAFF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里变成对战特区了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n现在不是打宝可梦对战的时候，\n改天再来！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC53D862105BF962187279533A4E86FF0100100001BE01000A73B057284E0D662F62535B9D53EF68A65BF96218768465F65019FF0C000A65395929518D6765FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是卡娜莉狂热问答王！\n打宝可梦对战也是一流水平！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F53615A1C838972C270ED95EE7B54738BFF01000A62535B9D53EF68A65BF962184E5F662F4E006D416C345E73FF01FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我输了，\n但我已经选好要用雷之石进化哪只<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n最强、最麻的麻麻鳗了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662118F934E86FF0C000A4F4662115DF27ECF9009597D8981752896F74E4B77F38FDB531654EA53EA00100001BE00000A67005F3A300167009EBB76849EBB9EBB9CD74E86FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你想得太简单了，宇满！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6060F35F97592A7B8053554E86FF0C5B876EE1FF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玛迷，\n我哪里错了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "739B8FF7FF0C000A621154EA91CC95194E865417FF1F00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们的卡娜莉小姐啊，\n并不是把实力强大的麻麻鳗<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n进化成麻麻鳗鱼王的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC768453615A1C83895C0F59D0554AFF0C000A5E764E0D662F628A5B9E529B5F3A592776849EBB9EBB9CD700100001BE00000A8FDB531662109EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738B76842026202600100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而是把原本很弱的麻麻鳗\n锻炼成了最强的麻麻鳗鱼王！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C662F628A539F672C5F885F3176849EBB9EBB9CD7000A953B70BC62104E8667005F3A76849EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738BFF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听得我浑身发麻……！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C5F9762116D518EAB53D19EBB20262026FF01FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "麻麻嘛……！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9EBB9EBB561B20262026FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然每只麻麻鳗都很可爱，\n那就每只都要爱！这才称得上卡友对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E271366BCF53EA9EBB9EBB9CD790FD5F8853EF7231FF0C000A90A35C316BCF53EA90FD89817231FF018FD9624D79F05F974E0A536153CB5BF95427FF1F00100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "战友啊！诚挚地感谢你\n愿意和宇满交手！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621853CB554AFF018BDA631A5730611F8C224F60000A613F610F548C5B876EE14EA4624BFF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宇满，为了提升来电伍的凝聚力，\n我们卡友一起来特训吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B876EE1FF0C4E3A4E8663D05347676575354F0D768451DD805A529BFF0C000A62114EEC536153CB4E008D77676572798BAD5427FF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    }
